#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:346
msgid "Import an Assembly"
msgstr "导入一个装配体"

#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:348
msgid ""
"The ``pc import assembly`` command allows you to import an assembly from "
"a STEP file. This command automatically parses the STEP file, extracts "
"individual parts, and creates an assembly YAML file that records each "
"part along with its transformation data."
msgstr ""
"``pc import assembly`` 命令允许你从 STEP 文件导入一个装配体。该命令会自动解析 STEP "
"文件，提取出各个零件，并创建一个 assembly YAML 文件，记录每个零件及其变换数据。"

#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:353
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "用法"

#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:361
msgid "Functionality"
msgstr "功能"

#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:363
msgid ""
"**File Parsing:** The command first attempts to parse the STEP file using"
" an XDE-based approach. If no parts are found via XDE, it falls back to a"
" classic STEP parsing method."
msgstr ""
"**文件解析：** 该命令首先尝试使用基于 XDE 的方法来解析 STEP 文件。如果通过 XDE 未找到任何零件，它会回退到经典的 STEP "
"解析方法。"

#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:367
msgid ""
"**Duplicate Filtering:** Unique parts are identified by comparing the "
"geometric data and applied transformations. Duplicate entries are "
"discarded based on a composite key of shape identifier and "
"transformation."
msgstr "**去重过滤：** 通过比较几何数据和所施加的变换来识别唯一的零件。会根据由形状标识符和变换构成的复合键来丢弃重复的条目。"

#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:371
msgid ""
"**Part Extraction:** Each unique SOLID is saved as a separate STEP file "
"in a dedicated subfolder. The transformation (translation and rotation) "
"of each part is recorded and later used in the assembly."
msgstr ""
"**零件提取：** 每个唯一的 SOLID 都会作为一个单独的 STEP "
"文件保存在专门的子文件夹中。每个零件的变换（平移和旋转）都会被记录下来，稍后在装配体中使用。"

#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:375
msgid ""
"**Assembly Creation:** An assembly YAML file is generated, linking the "
"parts (by file name) with their transformation data. This YAML file is "
"then added to the project, finalizing the assembly import."
msgstr ""
"**装配体创建：** 会生成一个 assembly YAML 文件，将各个零件（通过文件名）与它们的变换数据关联起来。随后，这个 YAML "
"文件会被添加到项目中，从而完成装配体的导入。"

#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:380
msgid "Example Log Output"
msgstr "示例日志输出"

#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:391
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:393
msgid ""
"The STEP file must contain more than one SOLID to be considered an "
"assembly."
msgstr "STEP 文件必须包含多于一个 SOLID，才会被视为一个装配体。"

#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:394
msgid ""
"If the file does not represent an assembly (i.e. only a single SOLID is "
"found), the command will raise an error."
msgstr "如果该文件并不表示一个装配体（即只找到一个 SOLID），则该命令将抛出一个错误。"

#: ../../source/tutorial.rst:395
msgid ""
"The transformation data is recorded as a combination of translation and "
"rotation (axis and angle), enabling precise placement of each part within"
" the assembly."
msgstr "变换数据以平移和旋转（轴和角度）的组合形式记录，从而能够将每个零件精确地放置在装配体内。"

